{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人何廣沛計劃今年與拍拖3年嘅圈外女友Sarah拉埋天窗，全城同賀！</p><p>去到年尾，佢終於上載二人甜蜜婚照，更寫上愛的宣言，令人動容。</p><p>自爆二人影咗過千張珍貴照片同影片嘅佢，走到去英國倫敦留下倩影，更對未來太太表示要用一輩子繼續寵愛佢，簡直甜過蜜糖</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T05:44:11.023574+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T05:07:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T05:37:17.729641+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T05:37:17.729641+00:00","content_hash":"f526e354054fc4b4ced16291ba93505ba26ab8e275d779c28a6f6b5ad7b36811","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}